 "description": "An alternative openpilot file that publishes only the radar's ACC target (0x235 / 0x237) as one point (upstream/ars510_acc_target.py), against fused 2.6 (upstream/ars510_radar.py) and vision only. Open-loop replays of every drive set in 6-segment chunks through the pinned openpilot's unchanged radard and planner; first 30 s of each chunk dropped. Hard = request <= -2 m/s2 while vision only >= -0.5; mild = <= -1 while vision >= -0.3; unnecessary / missed = against the hindsight-lead oracle (docs/12), whose reference lead is built mostly from the ACC target's range and therefore favours ACC-target designs; hard / mild and onset do not use it.",
